<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italy CCT auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italy CCT auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a fifth tranche of 3.0 trillion lire of seven-year Italian Treasury floating rate certificates (CCTs) paying a first coupon of 3.55 percent.</p>
<p>		   March 1, 2004 CCT	    Pvs</p>
<p>    Net Yield	   5.72 pct		6.98 pct</p>
<p>    Gross yield	 6.56 pct		7.99 pct</p>
<p>    Assigned price   99.40		   99.00</p>
<p>    Total bids	  9.067 trln lire</p>
<p>    Assigned	    3.000 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparisons are with a previous auction on March 27 of a 8.0 trillion lire third tranche of the CCTs.</p>
</text>
